flowchart TD
    A[Problem Definition] --> B[Data Collection]
    B --> C[Data Validation]
    C --> D[Preprocessing and Features]
    D --> E[Model Training]
    E --> F[Evaluation and Approval]
    F --> G[Version, Package, Deploy]
    G --> H[Monitor Data, Model and Service]
    H --> I{Quality or Drift Issue?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Investigate, Retrain or Roll Back]
    J --> B
    I -- No --> H
